# stashgen's golden test expectations. Marked `linguist-generated` so GitHub
# collapses them in pull-request and commit diffs by default and excludes them
# from repository language statistics. This is a GitHub display hint only:
# nothing about Git, CI, or the build changes.
#
# The generated *_stash.go files are deliberately NOT marked. They are the
# committed record of which fields are encrypted, with which indexes and under
# which context, so a change to them must stay expanded for the reviewer to
# read (docs/sdk-design-principles.md, Go principle 10).
*.golden linguist-generated
